---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Inspect a send operation after disconnect, including after draft cleanup

Usage: mxr send-outcome [OPTIONS] --account <ACCOUNT> <OPERATION_ID>

Arguments:
  <OPERATION_ID>

Options:
      --recover-known-not-submitted
          Preview or resume a legacy false-unknown using matched daemon log evidence
      --dry-run

      --expected-evidence-sha256 <EXPECTED_EVIDENCE_SHA256>
          Evidence fingerprint returned by the recovery preview
      --expected-workspace <EXPECTED_WORKSPACE>
          Original workspace JSON retained with the send review
      --account <ACCOUNT>

      --format <FORMAT>
          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help
          Print help
